WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club

﻿1

00:08:26.987 --> 00:08:28.630
Look at that guy!


00:08:29.587 --> 00:08:31.270
A damn bum!


00:09:10.747 --> 00:09:15.191
<i>Hey, you!
Are you lost?</i>


00:09:16.267 --> 00:09:18.751
- Hey!
- What the hell?


00:09:23.627 --> 00:09:27.431
<i>- Don't you turn your back on me...</i>
- Don't touch me!


00:09:27.987 --> 00:09:32.752
<i>- English?</i>
- What the hell?


00:09:32.767 --> 00:09:35.331
You're telling me what to do?


00:09:35.567 --> 00:09:37.892
Ole, stop it!


00:09:39.887 --> 00:09:41.811
- Who do you think you are?
- Ole!


00:09:44.527 --> 00:09:47.291
- Hey, hey,
- I asked you a question.


00:09:51.287 --> 00:09:52.451
Ole!


00:09:54.687 --> 00:09:55.731
Get up!


00:10:00.127 --> 00:10:03.251
If you touch me,
you will burn.


00:10:22.227 --> 00:10:25.372
Ole, stop messing around.


00:10:25.387 --> 00:10:27.831
Get up, come on.


00:10:33.027 --> 00:10:37.031
- Oh, shit! Ole!
- Call the police!


00:11:33.307 --> 00:11:36.092
She said she wanted to do it.


00:11:36.107 --> 00:11:39.831
<i>No one's blaming you.
Not the parents, no one.</i>


00:11:41.187 --> 00:11:45.532
<i>Everyone speaks highly of you.
Your colleagues, your clients.</i>


00:11:45.547 --> 00:11:50.951
<i>Unfortunately these things happen.
Therapy doesn't always help.</i>


00:11:53.387 --> 00:11:57.631
You just started out, and that makes
such an experience particularly horrible.


00:12:04.747 --> 00:12:09.012
<i>I didn't believe her, Margrethe.
She said everything I needed to know.</i>


00:12:09.027 --> 00:12:13.812
<i>- Didn't she have anyone else?
- No one. I could have stopped her.</i>


00:12:13.827 --> 00:12:18.172
<i>This isn't your fault.</i>


00:12:18.187 --> 00:12:21.791
It was all there for me
to do the right thing. I didn't.


00:12:22.907 --> 00:12:26.351
<i>You had no control over her.</i>


00:12:28.467 --> 00:12:30.132
Someone's calling.


00:12:30.147 --> 00:12:32.492
<i>You should answer that.</i>


00:12:32.507 --> 00:12:36.751
<i>Take some time off.
We'll talk tomorrow. Bye.</i>


00:12:42.067 --> 00:12:44.631
- Hello.
- It's Christine Aas.


00:13:12.107 --> 00:13:13.852
- Hi.
- Henrik. This way.


00:13:13.867 --> 00:13:17.292
<i>I have no experience with criminals.
I work mostly with teenagers.</i>


00:13:17.307 --> 00:13:22.492
<i>No one expects a miracle. We only
have an hour before the Crime Unit arrives.</i>


00:13:22.507 --> 00:13:25.532
I hope we can make him talk
before they take him.


00:13:25.547 --> 00:13:29.431
- What's his name?
- Eric Bergland.


00:13:30.907 --> 00:13:33.212
Sounds familiar.


00:13:33.227 --> 00:13:37.452
<i>The fire in Årdal three years ago.
Five people died.</i>


00:13:37.467 --> 00:13:40.492
- It's him?
- Norwegian-American. Backpacker.


00:13:40.507 --> 00:13:44.572
- In Norway looking for relatives.
- He's been in the woods all this time?


00:13:44.587 --> 00:13:47.831
There are still many questions
regarding that fire.


00:13:49.547 --> 00:13:52.932
But now we have three witnesses
saying he killed the boy.


00:13:52.947 --> 00:13:57.551
They say he barely touched him,
and he collapsed and died.


00:14:03.947 --> 00:14:07.031
- What has he said so far?
- Not a word.


00:14:08.907 --> 00:14:14.631
- Any indication why this happened?
- The big question for me is how.


00:14:52.887 --> 00:14:57.451
Eric, my name is Christine Aas,
I'm a psychologist, <i>I...</i>


00:14:58.527 --> 00:14:59.672
<i>I don't work for the police...</i>


00:14:59.687 --> 00:15:01.971
<i>...but they've asked me
to come here and talk to you.</i>


00:15:06.167 --> 00:15:07.891
<i>Would you like
to come here and sit...</i>


00:15:37.127 --> 00:15:38.291
Eric?


00:15:39.887 --> 00:15:42.091
Will you come
and sit with me, please?


00:16:19.007 --> 00:16:22.131
- My English is only so-so.
- Sorry.


00:16:23.647 --> 00:16:25.571
<i>I've never been to America, so...</i>


00:16:37.687 --> 00:16:39.531
You descend from Norwegians?


00:16:40.887 --> 00:16:43.672
Many generations back,
it seems.


00:16:43.687 --> 00:16:47.411
How did you find your family here?
<i>Online or...?</i>


00:16:57.007 --> 00:16:58.251
Eric?


00:17:01.007 --> 00:17:06.112
<i>A lot of people are wondering
what happened last night...</i>


00:17:06.127 --> 00:17:09.411
<i>...with you and the boy.</i>


00:17:11.887 --> 00:17:12.931
<i>I...</i>


00:17:14.247 --> 00:17:17.211
I don't think
you did anything wrong.


00:17:19.527 --> 00:17:21.992
<i>I think something
happened that...</i>


00:17:22.007 --> 00:17:23.931
<i>...nobody quite understands yet.</i>


00:17:25.487 --> 00:17:27.011
But maybe you do?


00:17:34.487 --> 00:17:36.331
<i>I think that sometimes...</i>


00:17:37.887 --> 00:17:40.171
<i>...bad things happen
to good people.</i>


00:17:40.887 --> 00:17:42.291
Awful things.


00:17:44.887 --> 00:17:46.331
It's not their fault.


00:17:50.367 --> 00:17:53.811
I think people are,
in their hearts, genuinely good.


00:18:10.887 --> 00:18:12.832
<i>I tried...</i>


00:18:12.847 --> 00:18:15.011
- I did.
<i>- I told him that...</i>


00:18:18.727 --> 00:18:23.051
<i>But he didn't listen to me.
He didn't listen to me, you know.</i>


00:18:24.447 --> 00:18:25.731
I'm listening.


00:18:30.127 --> 00:18:31.752
Tell me.


00:18:31.767 --> 00:18:34.552
I tried to tell him.


00:18:34.567 --> 00:18:36.531
It's my fault.


00:18:39.367 --> 00:18:42.011
I tried to tell him
not to touch me.


00:18:42.447 --> 00:18:43.571
And then he...


00:19:06.347 --> 00:19:09.911
Henrik, let's remove the handcuffs.


00:19:14.307 --> 00:19:17.751
<i>Henrik... Ole's parents
are in the reception.</i>


00:19:19.067 --> 00:19:21.751
<i>Bjørn refuses to leave
until he has spoken with you.</i>


00:19:28.267 --> 00:19:31.071
Remove his handcuffs and stay close.


00:19:34.107 --> 00:19:36.751
Therese.


00:19:52.427 --> 00:19:54.911
<i>- I can't even begin to...</i>
- Where is he?


00:19:56.267 --> 00:20:01.052
<i>I have to see him.
He killed my son. I have a right to...</i>


00:20:01.067 --> 00:20:04.452
We're still trying to understand
what really happened.


00:20:04.467 --> 00:20:08.092
<i>We know what happened.
The other boys saw the whole thing.</i>


00:20:08.107 --> 00:20:13.271
<i>Yes, we have their statements.
Now we have to hear his side.</i>


00:20:14.347 --> 00:20:18.231
I just want to look him in
the eyes. Once.


00:20:19.587 --> 00:20:21.911
I'm sorry, <i>Bjørn.</i>


00:20:34.827 --> 00:20:37.572
The Crime Unit is bringing
an American from the embassy.


00:20:37.587 --> 00:20:41.431
They want to take him out of the country.


00:20:42.347 --> 00:20:45.791
I'll be right outside.


00:20:54.967 --> 00:20:57.211
They were all your relatives,
right?


00:21:02.207 --> 00:21:03.691
The people at the farm?


00:21:08.047 --> 00:21:09.531
Did everyone die?


00:21:12.967 --> 00:21:14.411
Except you.


00:21:20.607 --> 00:21:22.371
I was sure you knew.


00:21:29.167 --> 00:21:30.731
I'm so sorry.


00:21:34.687 --> 00:21:35.891
Eric.


00:21:37.367 --> 00:21:39.531
What happened
at the farm in Ardal?


00:21:48.627 --> 00:21:53.471
<i>- Hi, I'm from Online News...</i>
- You have no right to be here.


00:21:55.207 --> 00:21:56.691
You know I killed them.


00:21:58.607 --> 00:22:00.512
And I killed the man too.


00:22:00.527 --> 00:22:02.771
I don't understand
how you could have.


00:22:45.487 --> 00:22:47.171
That's impossible.


00:22:48.287 --> 00:22:50.211
How do you do that?


00:22:52.727 --> 00:22:53.891
I don't know.


00:22:56.607 --> 00:22:58.672
<i>They were found burned.</i>


00:22:58.687 --> 00:23:00.691
<i>This...
This doesn't prove...</i>


00:23:33.287 --> 00:23:36.011
- Eric!
- Do you believe me now?


00:23:44.767 --> 00:23:46.491
What are you doing?


00:23:48.447 --> 00:23:50.552
Eric, stop this!


00:23:50.567 --> 00:23:52.691
- Stop it now.
- I can't.


00:23:59.047 --> 00:24:00.491
It's your emotions!


00:24:13.647 --> 00:24:16.411
- Turn it off!
- Turn it off!


00:24:19.507 --> 00:24:22.172
- You have to get out of here!
- No!


00:24:22.187 --> 00:24:26.871
<i>He needs help to stop this!
Turn off the alarm!</i>


00:24:28.447 --> 00:24:31.832
<i>Eric, it's your emotions!
You're setting this off!</i>


00:24:31.847 --> 00:24:33.832
<i>If you focus away
from your fears...</i>


00:24:33.847 --> 00:24:35.672
<i>...you can learn
how to control it!</i>


00:24:35.687 --> 00:24:38.752
It's coming from inside you,
so it's all up to you!


00:24:38.767 --> 00:24:42.611
Isolate yourself from everything
around you! You control it!


00:24:43.207 --> 00:24:46.251
<i>Just breathe!
I know you can stop this!</i>


00:25:22.107 --> 00:25:23.991
Are you okay?


00:26:00.167 --> 00:26:03.432
Eric, this is Cora Hathaway
from the U.S. Embassy.


00:26:03.447 --> 00:26:05.811
She's here to help you
get back to America.


00:26:06.827 --> 00:26:10.551
- They have no right to do that.
- It's not up to me.


00:26:10.807 --> 00:26:12.992
Eric, you have to talk
to them now.


00:26:13.007 --> 00:26:15.771
No, I just want to talk to you,
nobody else.


00:26:18.927 --> 00:26:20.291
Christine.


00:26:31.487 --> 00:26:33.891
Which is why we need
to sedate you, Eric.


00:26:38.087 --> 00:26:39.891
I'll do it myself.


00:26:42.847 --> 00:26:44.211
Eric?


00:26:50.827 --> 00:26:53.591
Watch his head.


00:26:55.867 --> 00:26:57.831
<i>They are bringing Bergland
to the helicopter now.</i>


00:27:13.867 --> 00:27:17.031
You know we'll never understand
what happened in there?


00:27:18.027 --> 00:27:20.772
Maybe we're not meant
to understand everything.


00:27:20.787 --> 00:27:24.671
I'm thinking God has
a plan with Eric.


00:27:27.787 --> 00:27:32.311
<i>Put this behind you.
It's someone else's headache now.</i>


00:28:21.927 --> 00:28:25.171
<i>He's burning up.
The sedation is wearing off.</i>


00:28:34.287 --> 00:28:38.152
Eric? Eric, relax.


00:28:38.167 --> 00:28:41.752
We're taking you to Oslo
and then somewhere safe.


00:28:41.767 --> 00:28:44.352
You'll be
well-taken care of, okay?


00:28:44.367 --> 00:28:46.272
<i>We're gonna find out
what's going on with you...</i>


00:28:46.287 --> 00:28:47.371
<i>...I promise.</i>


00:28:47.927 --> 00:28:49.211
- Eric?
- Give him another dose!


00:28:49.767 --> 00:28:51.512
- Relax.
<i>- I've already given him...</i>


00:28:51.527 --> 00:28:52.792
<i>...maximum dosage.</i>


00:28:52.807 --> 00:28:54.291
<i>Any more,
and he could die.</i>


00:28:57.087 --> 00:28:59.072
- Eric?
- Get me out of here!


00:28:59.087 --> 00:29:00.331
Get me out of here!


00:29:04.467 --> 00:29:07.671
Give him another dose now!


00:29:35.207 --> 00:29:36.272
- Eric?
- Do it now!


00:29:36.287 --> 00:29:39.651
Stop! Stop! Stop!


00:29:41.687 --> 00:29:42.872
Stop!


00:29:42.887 --> 00:29:44.211
Lie down!


00:30:09.527 --> 00:30:12.592
Zero-Zero, emergency,
all main engines switches to off.


00:30:12.607 --> 00:30:14.131
Override, Fox Two.


00:30:21.007 --> 00:30:22.192
<i>Mayday, mayday, mayday!
Helicopter going down!</i>


00:30:22.207 --> 00:30:25.331
<i>Helicopter Zero-Zero
going down...</i>


00:30:38.247 --> 00:30:40.832
<i>Mayday, mayday, mayday!
Zero-Zero, we're going down!</i>


00:30:40.847 --> 00:30:43.691
Ditch, ditch, ditch!


00:30:57.807 --> 00:31:02.251
<i>Spin out, spin out.
1,200 feet. Ditch! Ditch! Ditch!</i>


00:33:54.807 --> 00:33:56.352
<i>I will try to do this
in English...</i>


00:33:56.367 --> 00:33:59.491
<i>...since we have some
foreign people with us today.</i>


00:34:00.807 --> 00:34:02.432
<i>As we have not yet contacted...</i>


00:34:02.447 --> 00:34:04.952
<i>...the relatives
of the crash victims...</i>


00:34:04.967 --> 00:34:07.472
<i>...I can only say
that we have uncovered...</i>


00:34:07.487 --> 00:34:10.512
<i>...three dead bodies
in the helicopter.</i>


00:34:10.527 --> 00:34:12.352
<i>One American woman
is in hospital...</i>


00:34:12.367 --> 00:34:13.992
<i>...with smaller injuries.</i>


00:34:14.007 --> 00:34:16.091
<i>She's doing well
all things considered.</i>


00:34:16.927 --> 00:34:19.752
<i>I also cannot tell you the status
of the other American.</i>


00:34:19.767 --> 00:34:21.872
<i>But I'll keep you updated.</i>


00:34:21.887 --> 00:34:23.931
- Okay. Thank you.
<i>- Bjørn?</i>


00:34:37.067 --> 00:34:38.591
Where are you going?


00:34:38.787 --> 00:34:43.791
<i>The police confirm it is Eric Bergland
they're searching for in Odda.</i>


00:34:49.807 --> 00:34:50.971
Christine!


00:34:56.447 --> 00:34:57.771
Eric?


00:35:06.007 --> 00:35:07.131
<i>I...</i>


00:35:08.127 --> 00:35:09.891
The helicopter crashed.


00:35:28.527 --> 00:35:30.571
<i>Are you okay?
Are you hurt anywhere?</i>


00:35:36.087 --> 00:35:38.112
<i>I'm going to take you
to my friend's cabin...</i>


00:35:38.127 --> 00:35:40.771
<i>...and we'll figure it out, okay?</i>


00:35:54.087 --> 00:35:55.491
I'll be right back.


00:37:01.087 --> 00:37:02.611
I don't want to hurt you.


00:37:27.887 --> 00:37:29.011
Eric?


00:37:30.327 --> 00:37:31.851
How did this happen to you?


00:37:32.207 --> 00:37:33.451
What is this?


00:38:45.287 --> 00:38:49.251
Whoa, I'll just do it,
I don't want to zap you.


00:38:54.487 --> 00:38:56.411
Hey, how do I say thank you
in Norwegian?


00:38:57.367 --> 00:38:58.491
Norwegian?


00:39:00.127 --> 00:39:01.291
<i>Tusen takk.</i>


00:39:02.007 --> 00:39:03.491
<i>Tusen takk, Christine.</i>


00:39:14.207 --> 00:39:16.851
Is there anyone you'd like
to call back in the U.S.?


00:39:26.407 --> 00:39:28.091
When did it start?


00:39:32.527 --> 00:39:33.891
At the farm.


00:39:35.607 --> 00:39:37.211
<i>I got there...</i>


00:39:37.847 --> 00:39:40.771
<i>...something just started
building up inside of me.</i>


00:39:41.727 --> 00:39:43.312
<i>And then I just exploded...</i>


00:39:43.327 --> 00:39:45.091
<i>...and everything burst
into flames.</i>


00:39:47.327 --> 00:39:48.611
<i>And...</i>


00:40:20.167 --> 00:40:24.712
<i>It is crucial that you understand
how important it is...</i>


00:40:24.727 --> 00:40:28.051
<i>...to the U.S. government
that you get Bergland.</i>


00:40:32.407 --> 00:40:33.851
You're lucky to be alive.


00:40:35.407 --> 00:40:38.011
- That was some crash.
- Thank you.


00:40:39.127 --> 00:40:42.691
Two minutes before we took off.


00:40:45.567 --> 00:40:49.411
While we were in air
moments before we crashed.


00:40:50.207 --> 00:40:51.792
You mean he had something
to do with this?


00:40:51.807 --> 00:40:54.152
I saw it with my own eyes.


00:40:54.167 --> 00:40:57.611
<i>He created all that.
He made us crash.</i>


00:40:59.007 --> 00:41:00.651
He saved your life.


00:41:03.727 --> 00:41:08.192
<i>I'm not saying he's a bad person.
I don't care what he is.</i>


00:41:08.207 --> 00:41:11.731
We need to find him quickly
and get him under control.


00:41:35.827 --> 00:41:39.471
<i>Are you crazy?
He killed lots of people!</i>


00:41:40.907 --> 00:41:42.852
He didn't mean to hurt anyone.


00:41:42.867 --> 00:41:46.692
<i>- Christine! He's wanted!
- I know that.</i>


00:41:46.707 --> 00:41:50.572
<i>You're helping a criminal!
You could go to prison!</i>


00:41:50.587 --> 00:41:56.151
<i>Call the police
and explain what happened.</i>


00:41:56.587 --> 00:41:59.191
<i>This could ruin your life!</i>


00:41:59.507 --> 00:42:03.292
<i>Please call the police,
then call me when you've done it.</i>


00:42:03.307 --> 00:42:04.991
I have to hang up.


00:42:05.547 --> 00:42:07.911
<i>Let me know
when you've done it?</i>


00:42:08.347 --> 00:42:10.092
<i>- Hello?
- Okay.</i>


00:42:10.107 --> 00:42:12.471
<i>- Good.
- Bye.</i>


00:42:24.407 --> 00:42:25.531
<i>Christine?</i>


00:42:27.367 --> 00:42:28.411
<i>Christine?</i>


00:42:39.287 --> 00:42:40.731
Christine?


00:42:41.807 --> 00:42:44.451
<i>- I didn't mean to...</i>
- It's fine.


00:42:47.207 --> 00:42:49.072
I was thinking a lot
about the farm.


00:42:49.087 --> 00:42:50.971
<i>- And I was thinking I should...</i>
- Yeah.


00:42:54.607 --> 00:42:55.731
What?


00:42:57.527 --> 00:43:01.411
We have to go to the police
and you need to turn yourself in.


00:43:02.007 --> 00:43:03.811
<i>I just can't do this, it's...</i>


00:43:04.807 --> 00:43:05.971
I need to go home.


00:43:12.167 --> 00:43:14.571
I can give you a ride back down
if you'd like.


00:43:16.047 --> 00:43:17.611
And we could go in together.


00:43:19.047 --> 00:43:20.632
- I'm sorry.
<i>- No, that's alright...</i>


00:43:20.647 --> 00:43:21.851
<i>...I understand.</i>


00:43:58.607 --> 00:44:01.371
- You snore a lot.
- I snore?


00:44:02.807 --> 00:44:03.931
Sorry.


00:44:17.767 --> 00:44:18.891
<i>Christine...</i>


00:44:25.927 --> 00:44:29.051
<i>Christine, I just want
to tell you that I'm... I'm...</i>


00:44:47.647 --> 00:44:50.531
I just had a thought that I
wanted it not to rain on you.


00:45:14.607 --> 00:45:16.411
Let's not go to the police.


00:45:18.327 --> 00:45:20.731
<i>No. You've done enough for me.
I think you should go home.</i>


00:45:28.967 --> 00:45:30.411
I don't want to.


00:45:35.367 --> 00:45:36.851
We should go to the farm.


00:45:51.747 --> 00:45:55.692
<i>Locals are still in shock after
yesterday's tragic events...</i>


00:45:55.707 --> 00:46:01.431
<i>that drew international attention
to the small Norwegian town.</i>


00:46:01.647 --> 00:46:04.011
What do you think will happen
when we get to the farm?


00:46:05.567 --> 00:46:06.851
I don't know.


00:46:07.367 --> 00:46:12.371
<i>While I was there, it felt like
there was something...</i>


00:46:14.007 --> 00:46:15.371
<i>...calling me.</i>


00:46:17.487 --> 00:46:19.411
It was calling me
towards something.


00:46:42.347 --> 00:46:47.871
<i>Welcome on board MS Askeland.
The crossing will take 15 minutes.</i>


00:46:48.107 --> 00:46:52.791
<i>Food and drinks can be bought
in the canteen on the top deck.</i>


00:46:54.447 --> 00:46:56.192
I love ferries.


00:46:56.207 --> 00:46:58.691
It's like taking a break from
the world for a few minutes.


00:47:45.547 --> 00:47:50.812
<i>The police are asking anyone in Odda who
have seen Eric Bergland to contact them.</i>


00:47:50.827 --> 00:47:54.372
<i>He is a suspect
in yesterday's death in Odda.</i>


00:47:54.387 --> 00:47:59.172
<i>The police say the public should not
approach him as he may be dangerous.</i>


00:47:59.187 --> 00:48:03.431
<i>Bergland may be in the company
of this woman, Christine...</i>


00:48:51.927 --> 00:48:53.091
Eric?


00:48:55.407 --> 00:48:56.611
Are you okay?


00:48:57.967 --> 00:48:59.971
They know that I'm with you,
so we need to leave.


00:49:01.207 --> 00:49:02.251
Now!


00:49:26.127 --> 00:49:29.152
<i>What were you doing?
You can't just leave like that.</i>


00:49:29.167 --> 00:49:32.451
<i>Christine, the gas station,
the houses and the roads...</i>


00:49:32.567 --> 00:49:33.971
<i>...everything just disappears.</i>


00:49:35.127 --> 00:49:36.352
<i>One minute it's all there...</i>


00:49:36.367 --> 00:49:39.792
<i>...and then the next
it's just all fields.</i>


00:49:39.807 --> 00:49:42.011
And the sky just becomes
a different color.


00:49:43.967 --> 00:49:46.432
<i>Sometimes I just get
pulled into these...</i>


00:49:46.447 --> 00:49:48.832
<i>...these visions,
and I see things.</i>


00:49:48.847 --> 00:49:50.552
<i>I can't really explain it,
I just see them...</i>


00:49:50.567 --> 00:49:51.553
<i>...it happened since the farm.</i>


00:49:51.568 --> 00:49:53.152
<i>I can walk around,
I can touch things...</i>


00:49:53.167 --> 00:49:55.992
I can feel things,
I feel the wind, the heat.


00:49:56.007 --> 00:49:58.411
It's freezing,
it felt like I was freezing.


00:49:59.807 --> 00:50:01.832
And these are places you've been?


00:50:01.847 --> 00:50:02.912
No, they're not places I've been.


00:50:02.927 --> 00:50:05.032
<i>Some of these places
don't even seem possible...</i>


00:50:05.047 --> 00:50:06.392
<i>...like they're different worlds.</i>


00:50:06.407 --> 00:50:08.112
<i>And in the background
the sky's filled...</i>


00:50:08.127 --> 00:50:10.211
<i>...with this enormous shape
that looks like a...</i>


00:50:12.367 --> 00:50:14.192
- Like what?
<i>- Like...</i>


00:50:14.207 --> 00:50:17.232
I know it sounds strange,
but it looks like a tree.


00:50:17.247 --> 00:50:19.832
<i>Like this enormous,
beautiful tree...</i>


00:50:19.847 --> 00:50:21.651
<i>...that fills the entire horizon.</i>


00:50:33.727 --> 00:50:35.552
<i>When you were sleeping
in the cabin...</i>


00:50:35.567 --> 00:50:38.752
<i>...I just kept thinking
about everything and...</i>


00:50:38.767 --> 00:50:41.291
Like, will it stay with you
for the rest of your life?


00:50:42.847 --> 00:50:44.211
Where does it come from?


00:50:47.967 --> 00:50:50.851
- Are you the next Jesus?
- Jesus didn't make people die.


00:50:54.807 --> 00:50:57.832
<i>You can do things
with the atmosphere...</i>


00:50:57.847 --> 00:50:59.872
<i>...and air and water.</i>


00:50:59.887 --> 00:51:01.651
Who knows what else you can do?


00:51:02.887 --> 00:51:04.371
<i>Or what you can achieve if...</i>


00:51:05.367 --> 00:51:06.891
<i>...if you learn
how to control it.</i>


00:52:37.167 --> 00:52:38.531
Just let me talk to him.


00:52:48.807 --> 00:52:51.312
- Are you crazy?
<i>- I...</i>


00:52:51.327 --> 00:52:53.112
It's my boyfriend,
he's very sick.


00:52:53.127 --> 00:52:55.131
We need to get him to a hospital.


00:52:57.607 --> 00:52:58.931
Just, please, help us.


00:53:15.967 --> 00:53:17.971
Are you sure he's okay?


00:53:19.087 --> 00:53:20.131
Yes.


00:53:21.967 --> 00:53:23.131
<i>He's... He's fine.</i>


00:53:38.687 --> 00:53:41.411
If they cross that bridge,
we lose them.


00:53:42.087 --> 00:53:45.491
If we lose them,
they'll be in Bergen in no time.


00:53:46.807 --> 00:53:48.352
<i>We can't have a situation
in the tunnels...</i>


00:53:48.367 --> 00:53:50.251
<i>...before the bridge,
that's too dangerous.</i>


00:53:50.847 --> 00:53:53.651
They cannot reach a city,
you do agree with me, right?


00:53:56.367 --> 00:54:00.091
Just stop them
before they get to that bridge.


00:54:01.807 --> 00:54:03.011
Please.


00:54:41.767 --> 00:54:43.051
What's going on here?


00:54:50.287 --> 00:54:51.331
Is this for you?


00:55:22.807 --> 00:55:24.931
Don't shoot,
don't shoot!


00:55:28.087 --> 00:55:30.811
<i>Get out of the vehicle
with your hands in the air!</i>


00:55:59.447 --> 00:56:03.131
<i>This is your last warning! Get
out with your hands in the air!</i>


00:56:11.927 --> 00:56:13.451
I wish things were different.


00:56:32.247 --> 00:56:35.971
<i>Hands up! Over your head!
Get down!</i>


00:56:37.887 --> 00:56:39.691
Hands in the air!


00:56:43.327 --> 00:56:47.331
<i>Don't move!
Get down on the ground!</i>


00:56:47.347 --> 00:56:49.612
Stop, don't move!


00:56:49.627 --> 00:56:52.572
- Don't shoot!
- Get down!


00:56:52.587 --> 00:56:55.831
Don't shoot!


00:56:56.067 --> 00:56:59.351
Put your weapons down!


00:57:09.127 --> 00:57:11.952
- Don't! No! Don't touch her!
- Get down!


00:57:11.967 --> 00:57:12.953
Take your hands off her!


00:57:12.968 --> 00:57:14.632
Tell him to take his hands
off her!


00:57:14.647 --> 00:57:18.152
- Show me your hands!
- Take your hands off her!


00:57:18.167 --> 00:57:22.171
- Get down, or I'll have to shoot!
- Take your hands off her!


00:58:23.247 --> 00:58:26.091
Eric? Can you hear me?


00:58:28.527 --> 00:58:31.211
- Stay down!
- Stay down!


00:59:52.007 --> 00:59:55.211
<i>Eric, listen to me!
You have to stop this!</i>


00:59:59.087 --> 01:00:00.131
Eric?


01:00:00.767 --> 01:00:04.832
You have to focus on what you can
do and how you can control it.


01:00:04.847 --> 01:00:06.792
Get down, don't get up!


01:00:06.807 --> 01:00:09.032
<i>You need to do what you did
at the police station...</i>


01:00:09.047 --> 01:00:10.152
<i>...to make it all stop.</i>


01:00:10.167 --> 01:00:12.992
- On the ground!
- Keep all the noise out!


01:00:13.007 --> 01:00:16.992
- Stay down! Stop!
- Get down!


01:00:17.007 --> 01:00:18.171
Stay down!


01:02:21.267 --> 01:02:23.292
Help!


01:02:23.307 --> 01:02:25.911
Help! Help!


01:02:27.147 --> 01:02:30.711
- We need a doctor!
- Help me!


01:02:38.907 --> 01:02:41.271
Help me!


01:02:54.187 --> 01:02:56.231
Is he alive?


01:02:57.267 --> 01:03:00.191
I'll get you away from here.
Both of you.


01:03:03.507 --> 01:03:06.972
This is Henrik Jondal,
the sheriff in Odda.


01:03:06.987 --> 01:03:09.732
I have to get Bergland
to the nearest hospital.


01:03:09.747 --> 01:03:13.492
I want a confirmation from someone
official that no one will stop us.


01:03:13.507 --> 01:03:17.751
If you don't let us through,
you will be held accountable if he dies.


01:03:18.827 --> 01:03:23.951
<i>One moment. We'll get back to you
with a formal statement.</i>


01:03:29.587 --> 01:03:34.351
<i>We will let you through on the condition
that you go straight to Ulvik Hospital.</i>


01:03:34.627 --> 01:03:38.151
<i>We will set up a security perimeter
around the hospital.</i>


01:03:47.787 --> 01:03:50.492
You should have told me
your plans.


01:03:50.507 --> 01:03:54.591
You said there was nothing more
you could do. Why are you helping us now?


01:03:58.187 --> 01:03:59.932
I have believed in God
my whole life.


01:03:59.947 --> 01:04:04.071
If this has anything to do with him,
I don't want to be on the wrong side.


01:04:08.307 --> 01:04:11.892
- Where were you going?
- To the farm.


01:04:11.907 --> 01:04:16.412
- That burnt?
- He believes that is where it all started.


01:04:16.427 --> 01:04:21.252
<i>We're back with an update
from the police station in Hordaland.</i>


01:04:21.267 --> 01:04:26.532
<i>{\an8}Several police units attended a dramatic
arrest on Hardanger bridge...</i>


01:04:26.547 --> 01:04:30.871
<i>{\an8}when local extreme weather appeared
to hit the area around the bridge.</i>


01:04:32.487 --> 01:04:36.051
- With all due respect,
- I disagree.


01:04:37.607 --> 01:04:41.091
You haven't seen what I've seen.


01:04:42.567 --> 01:04:47.032
<i>Imagine in a few days when people
realize what he represents...</i>


01:04:47.047 --> 01:04:48.811
<i>...or what he doesn't represent.</i>


01:04:49.887 --> 01:04:55.152
Imagine Christians, Muslims,
everyone who believes in God.


01:04:55.167 --> 01:04:59.192
Suddenly a God-like human
proves they're all wrong.


01:04:59.207 --> 01:05:01.451
He doesn't represent any of them.


01:05:02.847 --> 01:05:04.851
What happens then?


01:05:11.807 --> 01:05:13.611
I think that's the only thing
we can do.


01:05:20.047 --> 01:05:21.651
I'll make sure it happens.


01:05:23.147 --> 01:05:28.732
<i>Witnesses claim that Eric Bergland
appeared to summon the storm.</i>


01:05:28.747 --> 01:05:35.212
<i>In videos taken at the site Bergland
appears to control the lightning.</i>


01:05:35.227 --> 01:05:38.332
<i>Social media are going wild
with speculation.</i>


01:05:38.347 --> 01:05:43.071
<i>Several have drawn comparisons
between Bergland and the Norse god Thor.</i>


01:05:43.207 --> 01:05:45.611
Are they calling me Thor?


01:05:45.727 --> 01:05:48.332
You can't blame them,
can you?


01:05:48.347 --> 01:05:50.012
<i>The University in Bergen
rejects this claim...</i>


01:05:50.027 --> 01:05:52.292
<i>He was an angry God,
but also a protector of mankind.</i>


01:05:52.307 --> 01:05:55.532
<i>I'm here with Maja Gundersen.
You witnessed...</i>


01:05:55.547 --> 01:05:57.652
<i>He will defeat everyone,
he's Thor!</i>


01:05:57.667 --> 01:06:01.431
<i>Bergland has been sent
to Ulvik Hospital for treatment.</i>


01:06:01.627 --> 01:06:07.231
<i>The police and army are securing the
site, the public are urged to keep away.</i>


01:06:37.427 --> 01:06:40.111
Ventricular fibrillation!


01:06:44.727 --> 01:06:45.771
Eric?


01:06:47.487 --> 01:06:48.571
Can you hear me?


01:07:23.527 --> 01:07:24.571
<i>Eric?</i>


01:07:25.207 --> 01:07:27.352
<i>- Christine? Where am I?
- We lost you.</i>


01:07:27.367 --> 01:07:29.952
<i>We lost you but the doctors
got your heart going again.</i>


01:07:29.967 --> 01:07:31.552
<i>They need to do
an MR scan.</i>


01:07:31.567 --> 01:07:33.592
No, please, will you just
let me out of here?


01:07:33.607 --> 01:07:35.952
<i>No, we need to see
what's going on inside you.</i>


01:07:35.967 --> 01:07:39.032
<i>I'm right here, Eric,
right outside.</i>


01:07:39.047 --> 01:07:40.411
Just talk to me.


01:07:44.927 --> 01:07:46.091
I was there again.


01:07:47.087 --> 01:07:50.851
This time everything was frozen,
like an Ice Age.


01:07:52.967 --> 01:07:54.731
It still had the same tree,
though.


01:07:58.467 --> 01:08:02.172
- What tree?
- What is he talking about?


01:08:02.187 --> 01:08:05.031
Sometimes he gets these
strange visions.


01:08:11.767 --> 01:08:14.971
<i>Okay, Eric, try to relax,
we'll just turn the machine on.</i>


01:08:16.367 --> 01:08:20.291
<i>Now we're scanning, there will be
some noises. Just relax.</i>


01:08:32.787 --> 01:08:37.812
<i>People have gathered outside Ulvik
Hospital, hoping to see Eric Bergland.</i>


01:08:37.827 --> 01:08:41.412
<i>The police confirm that they are assisted
by the American government...</i>


01:08:41.427 --> 01:08:45.471
<i>and the National Guard
to prevent an escalation of the situation.</i>


01:09:22.107 --> 01:09:25.351
This looks wrong,
how can he be alive?


01:09:32.907 --> 01:09:34.871
What was that?


01:09:35.887 --> 01:09:38.451
- Eric?
- Please!


01:09:39.267 --> 01:09:41.911
- You have to turn off the machine.
- It won't turn off.


01:09:43.167 --> 01:09:44.451
Hold on, hold on!


01:09:49.587 --> 01:09:51.071
What the hell!


01:09:56.787 --> 01:09:58.631
Is everyone okay?


01:09:59.887 --> 01:10:01.211
Eric, are you okay?


01:10:02.547 --> 01:10:07.311
The boy in ICU2 has gone into cardiac
arrest. All the defibrillators are dead.


01:10:07.447 --> 01:10:08.531
What did she say?


01:10:16.907 --> 01:10:18.671
INTENSIVE CARE UNIT


01:10:40.647 --> 01:10:42.251
You're a monster!


01:10:55.687 --> 01:10:57.571
You killed my only son.


01:11:05.107 --> 01:11:09.311
<i>- Bjørn!</i>
- This is a big mistake!


01:11:11.187 --> 01:11:14.231
Please. Don't do this.


01:11:23.927 --> 01:11:25.011
I'm sorry.


01:11:27.367 --> 01:11:28.971
I really am sorry.


01:11:30.767 --> 01:11:34.131
I didn't mean to hurt him.


01:11:36.127 --> 01:11:38.712
<i>There is somebody else's kid
about to die...</i>


01:11:38.727 --> 01:11:40.851
<i>...and you need to let me go
help them now.</i>


01:12:06.927 --> 01:12:07.971
Thank you.


01:12:34.387 --> 01:12:39.191
17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22.


01:12:43.767 --> 01:12:45.451
Can I try something, please?


01:12:49.127 --> 01:12:50.331
No, no.


01:12:51.027 --> 01:12:53.231
Let him.


01:12:54.127 --> 01:12:55.171
Please.


01:14:13.007 --> 01:14:14.731
Thor is Norwegian!


01:14:30.767 --> 01:14:32.011
<i>Eric...</i>


01:14:34.727 --> 01:14:36.891
- Touch me!
- Touch me, Eric!


01:15:20.427 --> 01:15:23.692
The army is fencing off the farm
to keep the public away.


01:15:23.707 --> 01:15:27.511
<i>And to keep things safe for Eric.
For us all.</i>


01:15:41.767 --> 01:15:43.411
What do you think they expect
from me?


01:15:48.987 --> 01:15:52.031
Read the page I've marked.


01:15:54.387 --> 01:15:57.271
THOR WITH THE HAMMER


01:16:00.007 --> 01:16:01.051
What?


01:16:02.487 --> 01:16:03.651
Are you all right?


01:16:08.147 --> 01:16:09.511
<i>Aft...</i>


01:16:10.687 --> 01:16:14.272
<i>After Thor and all the other gods
died at Ragnarok...</i>


01:16:14.287 --> 01:16:17.992
<i>...his two sons built a farm
on the ruins of Asgard...</i>


01:16:18.007 --> 01:16:19.152
<i>...to restart their lives...</i>


01:16:19.167 --> 01:16:22.072
<i>...and rescue all the knowledge
the gods possessed...</i>


01:16:22.087 --> 01:16:23.771
<i>...to prepare for their return.</i>


01:16:25.127 --> 01:16:27.392
<i>This place we're going to...</i>


01:16:27.407 --> 01:16:29.851
<i>...what if that is the farm
Thor's sons built?</i>


01:16:32.847 --> 01:16:34.971
What if that's the reason
you're connected to it?


01:16:37.007 --> 01:16:39.011
What if you are his descendant?


01:17:51.567 --> 01:17:53.352
Can I just have a minute, please?


01:17:53.367 --> 01:17:55.931
Why don't the two of us go up
and have a look first?


01:18:18.907 --> 01:18:21.252
It doesn't look that old.


01:18:21.267 --> 01:18:23.871
There may have been many houses here
through all these years.


01:19:22.167 --> 01:19:23.731
Do you remember anything?


01:19:26.247 --> 01:19:29.051
- I can't get up!
- I can't move!


01:19:45.267 --> 01:19:47.511
We need help to dig here.


01:19:55.387 --> 01:19:59.671
<i>Yes. Sierra 2 Charlie
has arrived at the site.</i>


01:20:00.507 --> 01:20:04.991
<i>They have requested an excavator
to dig under the fire plot. Over.</i>


01:20:11.007 --> 01:20:13.451
- Ma'am?
- They're ready for you.


01:20:34.807 --> 01:20:39.651
<i>Sierra 2 Charlie, we've got eyes
on target. Awaiting orders, over.</i>


01:20:41.967 --> 01:20:45.112
<i>If anything happens
that escalates the situation...</i>


01:20:45.127 --> 01:20:48.232
<i>- ...we're gonna fire on him.
- Copy that.</i>


01:20:48.247 --> 01:20:49.291
Like what?


01:20:51.807 --> 01:20:53.011
I'm not sure yet.


01:20:57.647 --> 01:20:59.171
It all happened so fast.


01:21:02.687 --> 01:21:04.451
<i>The house just lit on fire...</i>


01:21:06.687 --> 01:21:08.571
<i>And I just watched
those people die...</i>


01:21:12.687 --> 01:21:14.131
It wasn't your fault.


01:21:35.227 --> 01:21:38.751
Shouldn't we wait
for an archaeologist?


01:21:38.767 --> 01:21:42.792
<i>Eric? I think we've found
a crypt or a cave.</i>


01:21:42.807 --> 01:21:44.232
<i>We will go down first.</i>


01:21:44.247 --> 01:21:46.112
<i>I don't want to risk
another fire.</i>


01:21:46.127 --> 01:21:49.491
Stay here, and I'll let you know
if you should come.


01:21:51.967 --> 01:21:53.011
Okay?


01:21:59.847 --> 01:22:01.651
<i>Target is isolated.</i>


01:22:02.127 --> 01:22:03.392
<i>Looks like they have found
something...</i>


01:22:03.407 --> 01:22:04.651
<i>...underneath the fire plot.</i>


01:22:42.787 --> 01:22:45.991
<i>Runestones.</i>


01:22:52.467 --> 01:22:55.511
What is this place?


01:23:21.547 --> 01:23:24.612
<i>The knowledge of all
the dead gods...</i>


01:23:24.627 --> 01:23:28.572
which Thor's sons collected
after Ragnarok.


01:23:28.587 --> 01:23:31.351
They were described as runes.


01:23:32.307 --> 01:23:35.231
The Norse god's
own words.


01:24:06.507 --> 01:24:10.431
- Yggdrasil.
- The World Tree.


01:24:11.227 --> 01:24:15.831
Which shows the nine worlds
of the Norse mythology.


01:24:48.747 --> 01:24:52.031
It's time for Eric
to come down here.


01:24:56.567 --> 01:24:57.691
It's your turn now.


01:24:58.407 --> 01:25:02.251
See what it is and then get out
of there as quickly as you can.


01:25:07.087 --> 01:25:08.251
<i>They're ready for you.</i>


01:25:38.327 --> 01:25:41.472
Okay, Eric, follow the walkway
to the back wall.


01:25:41.487 --> 01:25:44.331
There's a mural there
with a big tree on it.


01:25:48.447 --> 01:25:50.992
<i>A box is in front of that mural.</i>


01:25:51.007 --> 01:25:53.131
The workers,
they are equipped to open it.


01:25:54.047 --> 01:25:57.691
<i>But please let them out of there
before you do anything.</i>


01:26:50.407 --> 01:26:51.651
What is this?


01:26:53.447 --> 01:26:54.491
I don't know.


01:27:00.807 --> 01:27:02.011
Let's find out.


01:27:23.767 --> 01:27:25.571
I think it's time for us
to leave.


01:27:34.567 --> 01:27:36.632
<i>The workers are coming back out.</i>


01:27:36.647 --> 01:27:41.171
<i>No visual on Bergland.
We assume he's still down there.</i>


01:28:50.447 --> 01:28:53.331
<i>Christine?
It's a hammer.</i>


01:29:26.487 --> 01:29:29.531
<i>The workers are saying
Eric is now alone with the box.</i>


01:29:29.627 --> 01:29:31.372
<i>They say they've found a chest.</i>


01:29:31.387 --> 01:29:33.431
- Did you hear that?
- A chest!


01:30:26.327 --> 01:30:28.691
<i>What's happening?
Are you okay?</i>


01:30:29.047 --> 01:30:30.731
The hammer is protecting me.


01:30:45.407 --> 01:30:47.091
<i>Please come back up.</i>


01:30:53.407 --> 01:30:55.752
<i>He's holding a hammer.
The object is a hammer.</i>


01:30:55.767 --> 01:30:58.611
<i>I can see something in his hand.
Permission to fire.</i>


01:31:15.647 --> 01:31:17.192
<i>We have civilians coming
to the site.</i>


01:31:17.207 --> 01:31:18.251
<i>What's the order?</i>


01:31:21.407 --> 01:31:22.491
Are we firing or what?


01:31:23.087 --> 01:31:24.971
- Ma'am?
- Fire.


01:31:38.287 --> 01:31:39.851
<i>Female casualty.</i>


01:31:44.087 --> 01:31:45.352
Christine, stay with me!


01:31:45.367 --> 01:31:48.851
<i>Christine! No, no, no!
No, no, no!</i>


01:33:26.387 --> 01:33:30.551
<i>The number of casualties following the
tragedy in Årdal is still unconfirmed.</i>


01:33:30.767 --> 01:33:33.091
<i>This is absolutely devastating.</i>


01:33:34.707 --> 01:33:36.271
<i>Norway is still in shock...</i>


01:33:39.527 --> 01:33:40.513
<i>The cult of Thor...</i>


01:33:40.528 --> 01:33:42.852
<i>With the terrorist Eric Bergland
still at large...</i>


01:33:42.867 --> 01:33:44.511
<i>There is still no sign
of Eric Bergland.</i>



















